    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17666" root="زرع" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُرْعَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرْعَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Seed,</i> or <i>grain, for
sowing,</i> or <i>that is sown;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذْرٌ</span>. (K.) You say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْطِنِى زُرْعَةً أَزْرَعُ بِهَا أَرْضِى</span> [<i>Give thou to me seed
that I may sow therewith my land</i>]. (TA.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرِيعَةٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And (tropical:)  The <i>young one of a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَبْجَة</span>
[generally meaning a <i>partridge</i>]. (Z, TA.)

